Kev-derived source in kev/model.py and kev/checkpoint.py originates from
Jared Palmer's Kev repository (https://github.com/jaredpalmer/kev),
Apache License 2.0, source commit 557598fced1dada75dfbf36ed144dce309ac6ceb.

The latent experiment modules were extracted from the local Kev research
workspace. In this export, latent_iit_run.py, latent_iit_trials.py, and
latent_interface_run.py import release_utils.py instead of the unrelated
scratchpad runner; release_utils.py extracts three helpers from that runner.
latent_interface_run.py hashes the renamed helper in its source manifest.
See provenance.json for per-file source hashes and changes. No pretrained
weights or training data are redistributed here.
